{"name":"Anita","hex":"#91a0b7","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Anita","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A female given name from Spanish."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Anita"}],"entries":[{"title":"Anita (1967 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Anita is a 1967 Indian suspense film, directed and produced by Raj Khosla, and starring Manoj Kumar and Sadhana. The film is the last of the suspense-thriller trilogy of Khosla-Sadhana partnership. Woh Kaun Thi? (1964) and Mera Saaya (1966) were the two previous films in the series. The movie was a hit at box office. The plot twist of the movie was based on that of the 1958 film Vertigo. Sadhana was praised for her portrayal of Anita despite the film underperforming at the box office."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/0b/Anita_1967.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anita_(1967_film)","wikidata":"Q4765486"},{"title":"Anita (2009 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Anita is an Argentine drama film released in 2009."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anita_(2009_film)","wikidata":"Q5696114"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"Anita":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/27/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-Anita.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/27/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-Anita.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-Anita.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/27/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-Anita.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-Anita.wav.ogg"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey Bushchat in Sillery Gaon March 2025 by Tisha Mukherjee 01","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_Tisha_Mukherjee